2026-07-27T09:16:52.7265450Z i /tmp/Rtmpzf6GmL/duckdb
2026-07-27T09:16:52.7265833Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T09:16:52.7266296Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T09:16:52.7266709Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T09:16:52.7267326Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T09:16:52.7268250Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T09:16:52.7269299Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
